:06.047">friend</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.486" end="01:10.310"><span begin="01:07.486" end="01:07.686">Go </span><span begin="01:07.686" end="01:07.894">ahead </span><span begin="01:07.894" end="01:08.143">and </span><span begin="01:08.143" end="01:08.480">cry </span><span begin="01:08.480" end="01:08.767">little </span><span begin="01:08.767" end="01:09.496">girl</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.310" end="01:12.739"><span begin="01:10.310" end="01:10.613">Nobody </span><span begin="01:10.613" end="01:10.983">does </span><span begin="01:10.983" end="01:11.149">it </span><span begin="01:11.149" end="01:11.406">like </span><span begin="01:11.406" end="01:11.673">you </span><span begin="01:11.673" end="01:12.454">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.739" end="01:15.706"><span begin="01:12.739" end="01:12.932">I </span><span begin="01:12.932" end="01:13.139">know </span><span begin="01:13.139" end="01:13.405">how </span><span begin="01:13.405" end="01:13.602">much </span><span begin="01:13.602" end="01:13.859">it </span><span begin="01:13.859" end="01:14.156">matters </span><span begin="01:14.156" end="01:14.453">to </span><span begin="01:14.453" end="01:14.956">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.706" end="01:18.643"><span begin="01:15.706" end="01:15.884">I </span><span begin="01:15.884" end="01:16.062">know </span><span begin="01:16.062" end="01:16.235">that </span><span begin="01:16.235" end="01:16.404">you </span><span begin="01:16.404" end="01:16.651">got </span><span begin="01:16.651" end="01:17.163">daddy </span><span begin="01:17.163" end="01:17.827">issues</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.643" end="01:21.347"><span begin="01:18.643" end="01:18.858">And </span><span begin="01:18.858" end="01:19.043">if </span><span begin="01:19.043" end="01:19.341">you </span><span begin="01:19.341" end="01:19.642">were </span><span begin="01:19.642" end="01:19.914">my </span><span begin="01:19.914" end="01:20.202">little </span><s